    <string name="terms_title">Terms &amp; Conditions</string>
    <string name="terms_body">Take a moment with these terms. Continuing means you accept them:\n\n• Caller ID Lookup names incoming, outgoing and unfamiliar callers as the call happens.\n• Nuisance, scam and fraud calls are flagged so you can shut them out.\n• Any phone number can be searched for whatever caller details are on record.\n• Your call log and contacts may be read so the app can do that work.\n• Drawing over other apps is what puts caller details on screen mid-call.\n• What we collect stays yours, and serves only caller naming and nuisance-call defence.\n\nChoosing “Accept &amp; Continue” confirms you have read, and accept, our Terms &amp; Conditions and Privacy Policy.</string>
